#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`Validation Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/validation>`"
msgstr ":doc:`유효성 검사 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/validation>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:15
msgid "What has been changed"
msgstr "변경된 사항"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you want to change validation error display, you have to set CI4 "
":ref:`validation View templates <validation-customizing-error-display>`."
msgstr ""
"유효성 검사 오류 표시를 변경하려면 CI4 "
":ref:`유효성 검사 뷰 템플릿 <validation-customizing-error-display>`\ 을 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:17
msgid ""
"CI4 validation has no `Callbacks "
"<http://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html"
"#callbacks-your-own-validation-methods>`_ in CI3. Use :ref:`Callable "
"Rules <validation-using-callable-rule>` (since v4.5.0) or :ref:`Closure "
"Rules <validation-using-closure-rule>` (since v4.3.0) or :ref:`Rule "
"Classes <validation-using-rule-classes>` instead."
msgstr ""
"CI4 유효성 검사에는 CI3의 `콜백 "
"<http://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html"
"#callbacks-your-own-validation-methods>`_\ 이 없습니다. 대신 "
":ref:`호출 가능 규칙 <validation-using-callable-rule>` (v4.5.0 이후) 또는 "
":ref:`클로저 규칙 <validation-using-closure-rule>` (v4.3.0 이후) 또는 "
":ref:`규칙 클래스 <validation-using-rule-classes>`\ 를 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:22
msgid ""
"In CI3, Callbacks/Callable rules were prioritized, but in CI4, "
"Closure/Callable Rules are not prioritized, and are checked in the order "
"in which they are listed."
msgstr ""
"CI3에서는 콜백/호출 가능 규칙이 우선시되었지만, CI4에서는 클로저/호출 가능 규칙이 우선시되지 않으며 "
"나열된 순서대로 검사됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:24
msgid ""
"Since v4.5.0, :ref:`Callable Rules <validation-using-callable-rule>` has "
"been introduced, but it is a bit different from CI3's `Callable "
"<http://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html"
"#callable-use-anything-as-a-rule>`_."
msgstr ""
"v4.5.0부터 :ref:`호출 가능 규칙 <validation-using-callable-rule>`\ 이 도입되었지만, "
"CI3의 `호출 가능 <http://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html"
"#callable-use-anything-as-a-rule>`_\ 과는 약간 다릅니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:26
msgid "CI4 validation format rules do not permit empty string."
msgstr "CI4 유효성 검사 형식 규칙은 빈 문자열을 허용하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:27
msgid "CI4 validation never changes your data."
msgstr "CI4 유효성 검사는 데이터를 절대 변경하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:28
msgid ""
"Since v4.3.0, :php:func:`validation_errors()` has been introduced, but "
"the API is different from CI3's."
msgstr ""
"v4.3.0부터 :php:func:`validation_errors()`\ 가 도입되었지만, API는 CI3과 다릅니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:31
msgid "Upgrade Guide"
msgstr "업그레이드 가이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:32
msgid "Within the view which contains the form you have to change:"
msgstr "폼이 포함된 뷰에서 다음을 변경해야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:34
msgid ""
"``<?php echo validation_errors(); ?>`` to ``<?= validation_list_errors() "
"?>``"
msgstr ""
"``<?php echo validation_errors(); ?>``\ 를 ``<?= validation_list_errors() ?>``\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:36
msgid "Within the controller you have to change the following:"
msgstr "컨트롤러에서는 다음을 변경해야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:38
msgid "``$this->load->helper(array('form', 'url'));`` to ``helper('form');``"
msgstr "``$this->load->helper(array('form', 'url'));``\ 를 ``helper('form');``\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:39
msgid "remove the line ``$this->load->library('form_validation');``"
msgstr "``$this->load->library('form_validation');`` 줄을 제거하십시오"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:40
msgid ""
"``if ($this->form_validation->run() == FALSE)`` to ``if (! "
"$this->validateData($data, $rules))`` where ``$data`` is the data to "
"validate, typically, the POST data ``$this->request->getPost()``."
msgstr ""
"``if ($this->form_validation->run() == FALSE)``\ 를 ``if (! $this->validateData($data, $rules))``\ 로 "
"변경합니다. 여기서 ``$data``\ 는 검사할 데이터로, 일반적으로 POST 데이터 ``$this->request->getPost()``\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:42
msgid ""
"``$this->load->view('myform');`` to ``return view('myform', ['validation'"
" => $this->validator,]);``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->load->view('myform');``\ 를 ``return view('myform', ['validation' => $this->validator,]);``\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:44
msgid ""
"You have to change the validation rules. The new syntax is to set the "
"rules as array in the controller:"
msgstr ""
"유효성 검사 규칙을 변경해야 합니다. 새 구문은 컨트롤러에서 규칙을 배열로 설정하는 것입니다:"

